    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESTORE COLOR</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/f75a9e478d221a878809afe8cc261aab.poster.avif?t=1754766134\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/f75a9e478d221a878809afe8cc261aab.webm?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/f75a9e478d221a878809afe8cc261aab.mp4?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Nectar is a 3D puzzle platformer set in a post apocalyptic world. Grow nature around you to solve puzzles and restore the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/6f8e0edd907d106d5446e7af4828e507.poster.avif?t=1754766134\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/6f8e0edd907d106d5446e7af4828e507.webm?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/6f8e0edd907d106d5446e7af4828e507.mp4?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use nectar to infuse the world with vibrant color, reveal hidden paths, and traverse areas that were previously inaccessible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER THE PAST</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/2786e9be0c58cd6cfd4916007aa011cc.poster.avif?t=1754766134\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/2786e9be0c58cd6cfd4916007aa011cc.webm?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/2786e9be0c58cd6cfd4916007aa011cc.mp4?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore a desolate wasteland and restore life to the natural world. Uncover a mysterious conflict of the past as you make your way towards your destination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALTER YOUR PATH</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/7b05a4fb5fa7f3e6f0966e90b1c3ed5f.poster.avif?t=1754766134\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/7b05a4fb5fa7f3e6f0966e90b1c3ed5f.webm?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/7b05a4fb5fa7f3e6f0966e90b1c3ed5f.mp4?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Be strategic and place nectar to solve puzzles. Utilize lasers, mirrors, and plants to augment and manipulate the world. To progress, you will need to restore the environment to its natural beauty.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARNESS THE MAGIC OF NECTAR</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/f294a3abe2723c1d83b5cd50249b5728.poster.avif?t=1754766134\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/f294a3abe2723c1d83b5cd50249b5728.webm?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596860/extras/f294a3abe2723c1d83b5cd50249b5728.mp4?t=1754766134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the magical properties of nectar to grow platforms and reach the looming tower.",
